+// ClusterKvGatedPrefixDecider extends CacheAwareKvGatedPrefixDecider with a
+// third OR-clause based on the decode-pool aggregate KV utilization:
+//
+//	clusterKvTokens = Σ snap.KvTokensInUse for snap in state.Snapshots
+//	clusterKvCap    = Σ snap.TotalKvCapacityTokens for snap in state.Snapshots
+//	clusterKvUtil   = clusterKvTokens / clusterKvCap  (0 if cap ≤ 0)
+//	gateFires       = (selected.QueueDepth >= queueGate)
+//	              || (selected.transientKvUtil >= kvGate)
+//	              || (clusterKvUtil >= clusterKvGate)
+//	Disaggregate    = (nonCachedTokens > threshold) && gateFires
+//
+// transientKvUtil is computed identically to CacheAwareKvGatedPrefixDecider:
+// max(0, KvTokensInUse - cachedBlocks*blockSize) / TotalKvCapacityTokens.
