+// ClusterIfrGatedPrefixDecider extends CacheAwareKvGatedPrefixDecider by adding
+// a cluster-aggregate InFlightRequests OR-clause. This produces a cache-independent
+// load signal: "how many requests are concurrently executing across all decode pods?"
