+// cluster IFR is below the confirmation threshold — targeting the spurious
+// kvGate firing on warm code rounds driven by chat KV pressure (RP-37).
+//
+// Degenerate cases:
+//   - clusterIfrGate=0: AND-clause always true (IFR >= 0 always) → identical to
+//     CacheAwareKvGatedPrefixDecider (h-ablation expectation).
+//   - clusterIfrGate large: AND-clause rarely satisfied → suppresses most disaggregation.
